    "detail": {
      "id": 1360102,
      "name": "[Attack: Eradication] Masquerade",
      "desc": "<color=#FFFFFF>Auxiliary Assist</color>: Hugo accumulates Energy over time. With enough Energy, press Auxiliary Assist to summon Hugo to launch an <color=#FFFFFF>Auxiliary Assist</color> attack on enemies. This skill always CRITs, and when a heavy attack from this skill hits an enemy, it <color=#FFFFFF>triggers the Totalize effect</color>, dealing <color=#2BAD00>DMG equal to 100%/20%/10% of the target's Max HP</color> to normal enemies/Elite enemies/Boss enemies respectively. When Hugo's <color=#FFFFFF>Auxiliary Assist</color> hits a Stunned enemy, it ends the enemy's Stunned state and deals <color=#2BAD00>additional DMG equal to a percentage of Max HP</color> to Elite enemies/Boss enemies based on remaining Daze duration, up to an additional 20%/10%.",
